# Database Naming Convention

## New tables

Any table specific to a feature MUST use that feature name as a prefix:

- `facebook_direct_posts`, `facebook_direct_schedule_pages`, `facebook_inapp_schedule_posts`
- `token_cost_rules` (platform-wide billing config)

## Legacy tables (Auto Download/Upload)

These tables belong to the **Auto Download/Upload** feature but are **not renamed** (avoids cross-service blast radius):

- `public.pages` — managed destinations + source username + schedule
- `public.reels` — scraped reel IDs per page
- `public.posting_jobs_v2` — download/publish pipeline jobs

When adding columns or RPCs for Auto Download/Upload, keep using these table names. Do not rename to `auto_download_upload_*` without an explicit migration project.

## Migrations

- One new file per change in `database/migrations/`
- Update `database/production_schema.sql` to match
- Include RLS for all new tables
